    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/2c9407f12395dfe3deb67e644e109cc1.webp?t=1754071202\" width=295 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive precision 3D platformer set within a deadly game show, hosted by the Elites for their twisted entertainment. Contestants, who voluntarily sign up, are transported to an 850-meter vertical tower, buried deep underground in an unknown location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.poster.avif?t=1754071202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.webm?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.mp4?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/b7b694a163340d2dc598cd79c9cc3374.webp?t=1754071202\" width=458 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong> -\u00a0no checkpoints and a speedrun timer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Mode </strong>-\u00a0frequent checkpoints and no timer.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/b312069162b3d4693ae132fa01d264f6.avif?t=1754071202\" data-has-big width=800 height=527 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/a85ec4fda65b0fc92f3cd09fd49ca355.webp?t=1754071202\" width=295 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the top to win a life-changing sum of money and your freedom. However, the stakes are as high as the tower itself\u2014fall, and it\u2019s the end. Every leap and maneuver is a matter of life and death. Can you survive the tower of Ikarus and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.poster.avif?t=1754071202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.webm?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.mp4?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/4def5eab2a7d22c4ef4ff75ee0977b82.webp?t=1754071202\" width=295 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the tower's deadly beauty,\u00a0an immense structure, split into four distinct levels, each with its own unique aesthetic, new obstacles and increased difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/2c9407f12395dfe3deb67e644e109cc1.webp?t=1754071202\" width=295 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive precision 3D platformer set within a deadly game show, hosted by the Elites for their twisted entertainment. Contestants, who voluntarily sign up, are transported to an 850-meter vertical tower, buried deep underground in an unknown location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.poster.avif?t=1754071202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.webm?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.mp4?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/b7b694a163340d2dc598cd79c9cc3374.webp?t=1754071202\" width=458 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong> -\u00a0no checkpoints and a speedrun timer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Mode </strong>-\u00a0frequent checkpoints and no timer.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/b312069162b3d4693ae132fa01d264f6.avif?t=1754071202\" data-has-big width=800 height=527 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/a85ec4fda65b0fc92f3cd09fd49ca355.webp?t=1754071202\" width=295 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the top to win a life-changing sum of money and your freedom. However, the stakes are as high as the tower itself\u2014fall, and it\u2019s the end. Every leap and maneuver is a matter of life and death. Can you survive the tower of Ikarus and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.poster.avif?t=1754071202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.webm?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.mp4?t=1754071202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/4def5eab2a7d22c4ef4ff75ee0977b82.webp?t=1754071202\" width=295 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the tower's deadly beauty,\u00a0an immense structure, split into four distinct levels, each with its own unique aesthetic, new obstacles and increased difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
